    PROCESS_ENV --> JWT
    PROCESS_ENV --> PAYSTACK
    PROCESS_ENV --> AMMA
    PROCESS_ENV --> SMTP
    PROCESS_ENV --> NFT
    PROCESS_ENV --> DB

    PROCESS_ENV -.->|"exposed via"| R1
    PROCESS_ENV -.->|"exposed via"| R2
